    { "Am I...just Cosmos's tool?", 20, 8 },
    { "Cosmos!", 21, 8 },
    { "Cloud, Cecil, and Tidus have each obtained their cyrstals.", 21, 1 },
    { "They've done it... They've really done it!", 21, 8 },
    { "Yes. Because they never stopped walking down the paths they chose.", 21, 1 },
    { "The paths they chose...", 21, 8 },
    { "Have you lost yours?", 21, 1 },
    { "I...never had a specific objective I could call my own... like winning against my father, or winning alongside my brother. I just wanted to bring an end to the conflict. It's like the Emperor said. I'm only a tool without a will of my own.", 21, 8 },
    { "That is untrue. You do have a goal. A dream that you have kept inside your heart for a long time.", 21, 1 },
    { "But my dream is nothing special. It's more like...just a childish dream.", 21, 8 },
    { "Tell me your dream-- and the future you wish for in your heart.", 21, 1 },
    { "Wild roses... My dream is a world filled with wild roses. When the battle is over, I want to fill the world with flowers. A world where we can overcome what we have lost, where even the rain and the wind can provide us with strength...", 21, 8 },
    { "It's a beautiful dream. A dream that was born out of none other than you. If you were a mere tool, you would not have had such a dream.", 21, 1 },
    { "Cosmos... You're right. It is my dream. And it's up to me to seize it.", 21, 8 },
    { "I wish I could have such a dream...", 21, 1 },
    { "And you can. I promise.", 21, 8 },
    { "(Many people lose their lives in times of war... They may die trying to protect friends, or trying to give strength to others. But in the end, they die. And there are others who lose hope, and grieve...)", 21, 8 },
    { "A future where happiness blooms like a wild rose... That's what I'm fighting for!", 21, 8 },
    { "I must press onward... For Cosmos's dream...and my own!", 21, 8 },
    { "What does an aimless tool of war want with me?", 22, 17 },
    { "I am not just a tool. I fight in order to make my dream come true!", 22, 8 },
    { "What's the matter? Are you done dreaming?", 22, 17 },
    { "We won't let it end!", 22, 9 },
    { "You guys!?", 22, 8 },
    { "You've gone far enough on your own.", 22, 9 },
    { "A friend's dream is our dream... We'll defend it together!", 22, 10 },
    { "Cecil and Terra should be joining us soon, but--", 22, 9 },
    { "You're going alone, aren't you?", 22, 10 },
    { "I must settle this.", 22, 8 },
    { "How did you--", 22, 8 },
    { "Show us the rest of your dream.", 22, 9 },
    { "That's right! We'll all be waiting for you.", 22, 10 },
    { "I'll be back!", 22, 8 },
    { "Always the same desires, the same aims... Mere puppets who cannot see their own strings.", 22, 13 },
    { "Such is the cycle.", 22, 11 },
    { "And again, you are saved by the light. Tell me, is your will so much stronger than the truth?", 22, 13 },
    { "... Your words matter not. All is nothing against the 'great will.'", 22, 11 },
    { "Everyone has supported me all this time... I won't keep them waiting any longer! I must succeed!", 22, 8 },
    { "I must carve my own path!", 22, 8 },
    { "You've come.", 23, 17 },
    { "I will not lose to one who calls me a tool of war!", 23, 8 },
    { "You and your pathetic dream. I should erase such flights of fancy. You're far better off as just a tool.", 23, 17 },
    { "Impossible. I have friends who share my dream. As long as my friends are here, the dream will never fade. You could never erase our hopes for the future!", 23, 8 },
    { "In that case--I shall simply make everything mine.", 23, 17 },
    { "What!?", 24, 8 },
    { "I'm trapped!", 24, 8 },
    { "You should have disposed of your fantasy and accepted me as master.", 24, 17 },
    { "What...?", 24, 17 },
    { "There is no meaning in strength only used to hurt others.", 24, 8 },
    { "I have dreams...", 24, 8 },
    { "Dreams worth dying for!", 24, 8 },
    { "What will an insect like you do?", 24, 17 },
    { "Believe in the future-- And persist in the present. That's what I'll do!", 24, 8 },
    { "This isn't over. Just you wait. Once you see how your dreams are crushed, you will be begging for my reign!", 25, 17 },
    { "(Perhaps the battle has just begun.) (In that case, let us keep dreaming.) (A world full of wild roses--) (Along with my friends, I'll make it come true.) It will come true. Someday!", 25, 8 },
    { "You think I'm outsmarting myself?\" [chuckles] \"I tire of your chirps, ignorant fool!", 26, 21 },
    { "Let me in on it.", 26, 19 },
    { "I've lost interest. [He flies away. Garland looks at Jecht] Garland: \"Surely you have others to spar with.", 26, 21 },
    { "Crystals...have the power to break through despair, huh? I wonder what they look like.", 27, 5 },
    { "Do you think we can find them? What if we do find them, but we still can't save the world?", 27, 6 },
    { "Gods always have a habit of sounding pretentious, don't they? There's no proof that Cosmos is telling the truth, but we don't know that she's wrong, either. Anyway, our only choice is to believe and move forward. Let's start with what we can do.", 27, 5 },
    { "Mm-hmm... You're right.", 27, 6 },
    { "Standing around here isn't going to give us any answers. Come on, let's get moving. You don't need to worry. I'm going to figure this all out.", 27, 5 },
    { "Look...the path ahead is hidden. Could enemies be hiding there? Or...", 27, 6 },
    { "Could be an ambush, could be treasure. Until we know, we'll have to be careful.", 27, 5 },
    { "Is that girl truly worth the trouble?", 27, 22 },
    { "Ab-so-lute-ly! Her powers are the real deal!", 27, 23 },
    { "Then we will take your word. We shall soon see how strong she is.", 27, 22 },
    { "You won't regret it...as long as she performs as well as she did before.", 27, 23 },
    { "Before?", 27, 22 },
    { "Oops, just talking to myself! Before, after, now, all the same! Now, off you go! Happy fighting!", 27, 23 },
    { "I sense many enemies here, too. Are we going to be alright?", 27, 6 },
    { "You just have to take a good look at the enemy before going into battle. Based on their equipment, you can figure out their weakness--the spell or the sword.", 27, 5 },
    { "Wait a minute...", 28, 6 },
    { "What?", 28, 5 },
    { "I feel something... Something very powerful from that direction...", 28, 6 },
    { "Do you think it's a crystal?", 28, 5 },
    { "I can't tell. It's just a strong presence.", 28, 6 },
    { "Let's check it out.", 28, 5 },
    { "What's wrong?", 28, 5 },
    { "Something about this doesn't feel right. I don't think we should get any closer.", 28, 6 },
    { "Terra, even if it isn't a crystal, we might find some clues. It's alright. I can handle any enemy that comes our way.", 28, 5 },
    { "But...", 28, 6 },
    { "Chaos's puppets may be strong, but they're just big lunkheads. And I've got something they don't... Right here, if you know what I mean.", 28, 5 },
    { "Come on, let's keep going.", 28, 5 },
    { "Are you sure about this? I think the enemies are getting stronger...", 28, 6 },
    { "There's nothing to worry about, Terra. It'd be reckless to just dive in, but watch carefully, and we'll find an opening.\" Manikins are brainless, but we're not! Use your head, and there's nothing to be scared of.", 28, 5 },
    { "You're so strong. I envy your courage.", 28, 6 },
    { "Could this be...", 28, 5 },
    { "such a warm light...", 28, 6 },
    { "Whenever your heart shatters, Flames of Rebirth shall protect you.", 28, 14 },
    { "Terra, you feel something?", 29, 5 },
    { "It's still up ahead... Watch out!", 29, 6 },
    { "Pawns of Cosmos, I presume.", 29, 24 },
    { "(Whoa... What is with this guy?)", 29, 5 },
    { "I come out here to kill the time, and what do I find but a woman and child.", 29, 24 },
    { "(No way I can look after Terra while fighting him. I've got an idea...)", 29, 5 },
    { "C-could you possibly let us go, sir?", 29, 5 },
    { "What?", 29, 24 },
    { "Our strength is no match to yours. We're hardly worth your time. I think you'd be much better off finding a stronger opponent to fight. Unless you're the cowardly type who only picks on those weaker than yourself...", 29, 5 },
    { "I suppose there is no point in sending harmless insects to the void. Very well. I will let you go. But keep this in mind, little worm. The crystals shun the unworthy hands of those without valor.", 29, 24 },
    { "Well, that was easy! Of course, even if he came for us, I would have run. I don't fight against anyone unless I know I can win.", 29, 5 },
    { "But...wasn't it a bit strange?", 29, 6 },
    { "What do you mean by that?", 29, 5 },
    { "It seemed like he let us go on purpose. He sort of even gave you advice when you wouldn't fight him...", 29, 6 },
    { "You mean the 'those without valor' line? Fighting against someone you can't beat isn't a sign of valor. It's simply being reckless!", 29, 5 },
    { "I'm sorry. I just--", 29, 6 },
    { "Then I'll prove it to you by getting the crystal. That'll show I'm not 'without valor.' Let's go. Do you still feel the presence?", 29, 5 },
    { "It's up ahead.", 29, 6 },
    { "Right!", 29, 5 },
    { "The girl awakens to the light. Your plans have come to nothing, Kefka.", 29, 24 },
    { "Nothing? Are you blind or just stupid? You saw her power firsthand!", 29, 23 },
    { "She was merely an empty vessel then. Not anymore. Even you must be aware that she acts on her own will now.", 29, 24 },
    { "So?", 29, 23 },
    { "So cease your plotting. She will never join Chaos. She is sided with Cosmos now.", 29, 24 },
    { "No way I'll give it up! I swear I'm going to draw her powers out. Then I'll be absolutely untouchable!", 29, 23 },
    { "I wonder where that man went... I hope everyone's doing alright.", 29, 6 },
    { "Eh, let them figure it out. They can use their swords if they want. Me, I'm using my brains. I just know the crystal is close.", 29, 5 },
    { "It's just... I have a bad feeling...", 29, 6 },
    { "Do you still feel it? Is it up ahead?", 29, 5 },
    { "Mm-hmm...", 29, 6 },
    { "Okay. We're almost there!", 29, 5 },
    { "It's here. Something powerful is close by.", 29, 6 },
    { "I don't see anything unusual. Let me go take a look around and--", 29, 5 },
    { "Terra?", 29, 5 },
    { "What is...this voice...in my head?", 29, 6 },
    { "No! What is this... Aaagh!", 29, 6 },
    { "Terra! What's going on!?", 29, 5 },
    { "Terra, what are you doing? Don't you recognize me!?", 29, 5 },
    { "Looks like I have no choice but to fight.", 29, 5 },
    { "Terra! Terra! It's me! Are you alright? Terra!?", 30, 5 },
    { "Stay out of the way. Her true powers are beginning to awaken.", 30, 22 },
    { "What have you done to her!?", 30, 5 },
    { "What?", 30, 5 },
    { "Who was the brute who chose not to ease the girl's pain, but to use his sword instead? Who was the fool who dragged the unwilling girl here?", 30, 22 },
    { "I, I--", 30, 5 },
    { "The girl knew in her heart all along. That is why she was so reluctant! You have only yourself to blame for this. Your shallow cleverness got the best of you! Curse your own ignorance and powerlessness. Nothing you can do can save the girl!", 30, 22 },
    { "Terra...", 30, 5 },
    { "I felt the fear in Terra's cry. She is in pain. The Cloud of Darkness has taken hold of her with her curse...", 31, 1 },
    { "It's my fault...", 31, 5 },
    { "Yes. Because you were overconfident of your powers.", 31, 1 },
    { "Cosmos, you know how... You know how to save Terra, don't you?", 31, 5 },
    { "You must defeat the Cloud of Darkness.", 31, 1 },
    { "Her...? But I can't fight her... I don't fight against anyone I can't beat... Oh, right! The crystal! I should be able to save Terra if I can get my hands on the crystal... It has the power to save the world, right? Then I won't have to fight anybody! Please, just tell me where I should go find the crystal!", 31, 5 },
    { "Avoiding conflict is certainly a choice. Few would say it is wrong. But is that truly what is in your heart?", 31, 1 },
    { "What's in my heart...?", 31, 5 },
    { "The crystal lights the way to what you seek. It is yours if you look inside your heart and follow what is most important to you. I'm afraid that is all I can tell you.", 31, 1 },
    { "Chaos's minion...", 31, 5 },
    { "Terra was her name, was it not? Unless the curse is lifted, she will live only to fight for the Cloud of Darkness. When at last her strength fails her, she will fall to some faceless foe. You cannot defeat the Cloud of Darkness. You'd show wisdom in choosing to avoid her. Why do you hesitate? You do not trust what your mind knows to be true?", 31, 16 },
    { "I...", 31, 5 },
    { "If not to reason, then listen to your heart.", 31, 16 },
    { "I know I have to save Terra. But how can I fight HER and win? Wait... Yeah! That just might work...", 31, 5 },
    { "She must be close. I can smell the stench of darkness...", 31, 5 },
    { "Unconscious already... She's too fragile to be of any use.", 32, 22 },
    { "Well, now. Have you not learned yet? Are you here to challenge us again?", 32, 22 },
    { "I don't fight anyone that I can't defeat. I will do whatever you want. So please, spare Terra's life.", 32, 5 },
    { "So you have learned after all. Your decision is a wise one. Very well. Then you shall serve us.", 32, 22 },
    { "Prove yourself more useful than the girl.", 32, 22 },
    { "I didn't think you'd be so gullible.", 32, 5 },
    { "No way I'm joining Chaos!", 32, 5 },
    { "I finally got it. I was a fool to defy my heart, just to bind myself to reason. I will protect Terra with my own strength. That's what's most important to me! Don't get me wrong--I still won't fight against anyone I can't beat. But I've decided in my heart to fight. That's why I'm going to beat you!", 32, 5 },
    { "You have already taken such a beating...", 33, 22 },
    { "Gotcha!", 33, 5 },
    { "What awaits when you awake is always--", 33, 22 },
    { "nothing but despair.", 33, 22 },
    { "But can you use it?", 33, 22 },
    { "Terra!", 34, 5 },
    { "Terra!!!", 34, 5 },
    { "She merely fainted. The girl drew too deeply upon her powers.", 34, 16 },
    { "You again... You're not getting near Terra!", 34, 5 },
    { "I admire your resolve. You should protect her.", 34, 16 },
    { "What?", 34, 5 },
    { "For all the awesome power she wields, the girl fears what she is. You must be her shield, her pillar of support.", 34, 16 },
    { "I don't need you to tell me that!", 34, 5 },
    { "I suppose not. You know the path that lies before you. And the crystal lights the way to that which you seek.", 34, 16 },
    { "This is the crystal...", 34, 5 },
    { "Where are we...?", 34, 6 },
    { "Terra... Everything is alright. I'll be right here, so you can rest.", 34, 5 },
    { "Because I'll protect you. But...maybe for a minute, I'll--", 34, 5 },
    { "BOOOOOO!!! How could she not draw out the girl's powers? That hag isn't worth the dirt on the bottom of my boots! This is why I hate working with amateurs. Guess it's my turn to stir up some trouble!", 34, 23 },
    { "Why not break her now? So fragile...it would be simple.", 35, 22 },
    { "I wanna have some fun! After all, she's a-- good ol' friend of mine!", 35, 23 },
    { "(I thought if only I were diligent, what I sought would soon be mine. Yet still, the true path eludes me. What must I do to find the crystal? The world isn't waiting for me to--)", 36, 7 },
    { "Brother!", 36, 7 },
    { "Lose yourself in the fog of doubt and reverie, and you will never reach the crystal. It will forever remain but a dream.", 36, 16 },
    { "I lose my way because it is a dream.", 36, 7 },
    { "What does that mean?", 36, 7 },
    { "If you want to know the secret of the crystal, follow my shadow.", 36, 16 },
    { "Are you alright? That was...Golbez, wasn't it? Isn't he sided with Chaos?", 36, 8 },
    { "He's also...my brother.", 36, 7 },
    { "Be that as it may...he's with the enemy. What did he say to you?", 36, 8 },
    { "He said he knows the secret of the crystal-- that I should follow him if I want it.", 36, 7 },
    { "Cecil, this is hard for me to say... but lower your gard and the darkness may lead you to a trap.", 36, 8 },
    { "That can't be--", 36, 7 },
    { "Let's go. Tidus is getting impatient. It's better to forget what he told you. I don't want to see my friend walk into danger.", 36, 8 },
    { "What should I do?", 36, 7 },
    { "Let us be off, Cecil. We've no time to waste.", 36, 8 },
    { "Of course...", 36, 7 },
    { "You are quite the thespian, Golbez. So, do you think we can lure him in?", 36, 17 },
    { "Not to worry. I know my brother. His faith is easily won.", 36, 16 },
    { "Good. I am counting on you.", 36, 17 },
    { "The secret of the crystal...", 36, 7 },
    { "What's the matter, Cecil? Something on your mind?", 36, 10 },
    { "No... Nothing at all. Let us hurry. The crystal may be near. ... Brother... Can I believe you?", 36, 7 },
    { "The enemies here are persistent. How are you faring, Cecil?", 36, 8 },
    { "What? Oh, I'm fine. ...Thank you, Firion.", 36, 7 },
    { "Whatcha doin' out here?", 37, 10 },
    { "I was just thinking about what my brother said.", 37, 7 },
    { "You mean that thing about 'the secret of the crystal'?", 37, 10 },
    { "The same. I wish I knew what he was trying to tell me.", 37, 7 },
    { "Then why don't you just go ask him?", 37, 10 },
    { "What?", 37, 7 },
    { "That's what you really want to do, isn't it?", 37, 10 },
    { "Yes. When I think about the risks my brother must have taken to come see me, I--", 37, 7 },
    { "Save it, Cecil! You want to see him. That's all that counts!", 37, 10 },
    { "But Firion was concerned that--", 37, 7 },
    { "Who cares what Firion says? All that matters is that you come back in one piece! Let me worry about Firion, okay? Just hurry up and go already!", 37, 10 },
    { "Truly? Are you sure?", 37, 7 },
    { "Try listening to your friends more often!", 37, 10 },
    { "Thank you. I'll not be long. You've my word on it.", 37, 7 },
    { "Family...", 37, 10 },
    { "So...how will I explain this one?", 37, 10 },
    { "I need to find some answers. Not only for myself, but for everyone! I must hurry to my brother!", 37, 7 },
    { "Could this glow belong to a Summonstone?", 37, 7 },
    { "Call me whenever you need me! I'll lend you my light!", 37, 25 },
    { "So you've come, Cecil.", 38, 16 },
    { "Why tell me the secret of the crystal?", 38, 7 },
    { "And why have you come all this way?\" [chuckles] \"Most likely for the same reason. A brother cares for his kin. Cecil...I am here to gauge whether or not you are worthy of obtaining the crystal.", 38, 16 },
    { "Worthy?", 38, 7 },
    { "Indeed. That is why--", 38, 16 },
    { "Two losts souls, wandering in the dark. Or is this what they mean by brotherly love? I did not expect you to be bound yet to the other side, Golbez.\" [chuckles] \"You are a fool and a coward, longing for the light!", 38, 24 },
    { "It's none of your concern.", 38, 16 },
    { "On the contrary, feeble mortal. For it is I who shall punish those who betray us!", 38, 24 },
    { "I won't let you lay a finger on him!", 38, 7 },
    { "Cecil!", 38, 16 },
    { "I don't know if you'll deem me worthy. But... at least I can show you my strength!", 38, 7 },
    { "My brother...is not the same as you!", 39, 7 },
    { "Why has the crystal not appeared?", 39, 16 },
    { "What's wrong?", 39, 7 },
    { "I only fought him for you... Please, won't you join me?", 39, 7 },
    { "What?", 39, 16 },
    { "I must tell my friends what you just told me. They too seek their own crystals. Once the crystals are gathered, the battle will be over. Then, you and I, we could--", 39, 7 },
    { "Enough. I am merely your shadow. I could not accept the darkness, yet I do not belong to the light.", 39, 16 },
    { "What?", 39, 7 },
    { "You disappoint me, Cecil. Like this, you will not receive the crystal's eternal light.", 39, 16 },
    { "Brother...? Why?", 39, 7 },
    { "'You disappoint me'... I don't understand what he seeks. What am I to do?", 39, 7 },
    { "I should return to my friends. But--", 40, 7 },
    { "Brother! You came!", 40, 7 },
    { "To set you on the proper path.", 40, 16 },
    { "What?", 40, 7 },
    { "You cling to the skirts of your companions. Is that the sign of a strong will? The crystal will never shine on those who always depend on others. You must act alone to accomplish the goal you have been given.", 40, 16 },
    { "But I cannot abandon my friends if they are in need! All I want is for us to look for our crystals together!", 40, 7 },
    { "So I see. In that case--", 40, 16 },
    { "What are you--", 40, 7 },
    { "Now do you see? The bonds between people are unreliably fragile. The friendship you believe in is nothing but an illusion.", 40, 16 },
    { "Brother...", 40, 7 },
    { "Lighten up, big guy. Did you really expect this to be a cakewalk?", 40, 19 },
    { "Jecht... So you were listening.", 40, 16 },
    { "What a hassle, eh? Dealing with these types of relationships is the pits.", 40, 19 },
    { "...I am Cecil's enemy. That is why I will not leave him again.", 40, 16 },
    { "Sure, sure. Just, sometimes you've gotta let things go if you want 'em to succeed.", 40, 19 },
    { "Indeed? And what is it you intend to abandon?", 40, 16 },
    { "Cosmos... I'm not sure of anything anymore. Not once did I doubt that we could find the crystals by working together. In fact, I believed cooperation to be the only way. But my brother-- Golbez says that I must seek the crystal alone. Have I been naive to think we could work together? Is the bond I have with my friends really only an illusion?", 41, 7 },
    { "Do you look to me for answers? The crystal does not shine on those who only depend on others. What your brother says is absolutely true.", 41, 1 },
    { "How could that--", 41, 7 },
    { "Do not be troubled. Cast your worries aside, for that which you seek lies near.", 41, 1 },
    { "What?", 41, 7 },
    { "You already know in your heart. To depend on others, and to work together with others-- are they the same things to you? I know that you can reach the light because you are worthy.", 41, 1 },
    { "Cosmos, does that mean--", 41, 7 },
    { "The answer can be found inside you.", 41, 1 },
    { "I-- I must do this.", 41, 7 },
    { "I must return to the people I trust. The answers lie with them!", 41, 7 },
    { "Now I know that I must fight... no matter who my opponent might be.", 41, 7 },
    { "There is a different air about you. You seem to have made a decision.", 42, 16 },
    { "Yes. I will return to my friends.", 42, 7 },
    { "What?", 42, 16 },
    { "Brother...I do not travel with companions to cover my own weakness. Their presence gives me strength. They encourage and support me. I travel with them so that I can aid them as they have aided me. A certain strength can only be born in the presence of my friends. That's why! This is what I believe!", 42, 7 },
    { "It looks as though our differences are irreconcilable.", 42, 16 },
    { "Brother...", 42, 7 },
    { "You are a knight. If there is such determination behind your thoughts... prove it with your blade, my brother!", 42, 16 },
    { "It's because I have friends that I can fight! Both light and darkness give me the guidance I need. Thus--", 43, 7 },
    { "I can turn darkness--", 43, 7 },
    { "into hallowed light!", 43, 7 },
    { "Behold!", 43, 7 },
    { "You're naive, Cecil. Even knowing betrayal and despair, you would depend on the whims of others?", 43, 16 },
    { "I swear on this blade-- I will not be dissuaded!", 43, 7 },
    { "I see the strength of which you spoke.", 43, 16 },
    { "This is ours, Brother. We found this light together.", 43, 7 },
    { "Spare me the folderol. You found that on your own.", 43, 16 },
    { "But--", 43, 7 },
    { "This is only the beginning. Do your eyes see as far as the light shines?", 43, 16 },
    { "Brother... No matter the hardship, I'll face it head on, together with my friends.", 43, 7 },
    { "(And someday, with you as well. Because our bond is my guiding light.)", 43, 7 },
    { "My mind will not waver.", 43, 7 },
    { "It was right to give him space. We now see his true colors.", 43, 17 },
    { "Indeed. He is a betrayer to the last.", 43, 24 },
    { "I suppose it was only a matter of time until he became aware of the light within him... Nevertheless, we must resolve this issue before Shrinyu makes its move.", 43, 17 },
    { "You coming with us?", 44, 2 },
    { "Guess what? The story continues.", 44, 9 },
    { "Where am I?", 45, 4 },
    { "So now...where is that mouse you caught?", 45, 21 },
    { "Hmmm? Well, now, this is odd. He was here just a minute ago...", 45, 23 },
    { "Anyway, the one I'm after is Zidane.\" [groans] \"I didn't even ask you to do this. Now you've made it harder to catch him.", 45, 21 },
    { "But it looked like fun! No fair hogging it all!", 45, 23 },
    { "Though I suppose it would be foolish to let this mouse go to waste...", 45, 21 },
    { "(Huh, so that trap was supposed to be for Zidane.) (Good thing they didn't catch him,) (but who are they to call me a mouse!?) (I wonder what those guys are talking about over there.)", 45, 4 },
    { "Might as well take a look around. With any luck, I just might find my crystal!", 45, 4 },
    { "Everyone's skills are going to come in handy!", 45, 4 },
    { "Alrighty, now I've gotta find a way outta here. Hm... I might be able to transport to another place by smashing that insignia!", 45, 4 },
    { "I feel good! Keep 'em coming!", 45, 4 },
    { "I hear you let both the boy and girl go. So much for the destroyer image, hmmm?", 45, 21 },
    { "When I am victorious, all will return to the Void. Why not allow them to witness it?", 45, 24 },
    { "Very well. As you seem to be bored, how would you like a role in my next play? It's the tale of an overly inquisitive wind that comes blustering into misfortune...", 45, 21 },
    { "...I am listening.", 45, 24 },
    { "As much as I like wandering around aimlessly, I gotta go somewhere.", 46, 4 },
    { "(Oooh, I wonder what's going on over there.)", 46, 4 },
    { "No doubt paradise is within our grasp. What matters is afterwards. What say you join forces with me, Sephiroth? You, too, must be sickened by the feckless destroyers among us.", 46, 17 },
    { "Not interested.", 46, 13 },
