    { "I wanted to thank you.", 55, 6 },
    { "Huh?", 55, 5 },
    { "For cheering me up back there. To be honest, I was getting scared. It seems like I've been getting nowhere while everyone else is making strides. It frustrates me that I still don't know where to go. I wonder if things will change once I find the crystal.", 55, 6 },
    { "Not exactly.", 55, 5 },
