    { "Bingo! That's exactly what I mean! You beat your precious companion, that little kid, to a bloody pulp! It looked like you were enjoying it. How could you forget?\" [laughs] \"You are such a dangerous creature. The more you fight, the more your powers grow out of control! Destruction, incarnate! That's what you are, my dear!", 56, 23 },
