    { "Why not? He is your father, right?", 95, 8 },
    { "And I hate his guts. He's a bully who always treated me like a little kid. I swore I'd beat the lights out of him someday. So, I'm gonna enjoy this!", 95, 10 },
    { "Alright. In that case--", 95, 8 },
    { "Off we go!", 95, 10 },
    { "What a weird looking ball...", 95, 10 },
    { "It's a pleasure to make your acquaintance! We're the Magus Sisters. I'm Sandy! She's Cindy, and she's Mindy! Don't forget it!", 95, 31 },
    { "Phew, time for a break. Wonder if Firion's made it to the rendezvous point yet.", 95, 10 },
    { "Okay! All clear over here!", 96, 10 },
    { "Huh? Firion! Yoohoo! Rosebud! Where are you? Is he lost?", 96, 10 },
    { "Dad!", 96, 10 },
    { "What's wrong? I'm standing right here. Come and get me. Or are you so scared that you can't even move?", 96, 19 },
    { "I'm not scared!", 96, 10 },
    { "What is it now, Your Majesty?", 96, 19 },
    { "Your son stands before you driven by a fierce hatred. This does not aid us in our endeavors.", 96, 17 },
    { "What are you guys babbling about!?", 96, 10 },
    { "He says we can't fight today. Let's save it for later.", 96, 19 },
    { "Wait a minute! Don't bail out on me!", 96, 10 },
    { "Outta the way!", 96, 10 },
    { "I suggest you direct that aggression towards me.", 96, 17 },
    { "Hatred alone will never yield the crystal. Your prayers shall be heard by no one.", 97, 17 },
    { "What does that mean!? Try making some sense!", 97, 10 },
    { "(When it came down to it,) (my problem wasn't that he got away.) (The thing that really made me mad was--)", 97, 10 },
    { "It just isn't like you... Taking orders like that!", 97, 10 },
    { "Jecht. It seems you could not 'let go' of your past after all.", 97, 16 },
    { "...The past ain't important. I just wanna know if doing this'll put the world back as it was.", 97, 19 },
    { "If it does...will you be satisfied? Will you blindly follow that man's words until the moment he betrays you?", 97, 16 },
    { "I... Dammit!", 97, 19 },
    { "Firion! Are you okay?", 98, 10 },
    { "I get it now. Like father, like son. What a resemblance.", 98, 8 },
    { "Was it him? Was my old man here?", 98, 10 },
    { "Until just a second ago. We crossed swords, but I let him go. Jecht is yours to defeat. I can't take that from you. Come on, let's go finish this!", 98, 8 },
    { "Yeah...", 98, 10 },
    { "What's wrong?", 98, 8 },
    { "That guy in gold... The Emperor? He said something to me. 'Hatred alone will never yield the crystal.' I wonder what that means.", 98, 10 },
    { "He uses words only as tools to deceive. All you need to do is stay true to yourself. You want to settle things with your father, don't you?", 98, 8 },
    { "You bet I do.", 98, 10 },
    { "Then hesitate no more. Let's go after Jecht!", 98, 8 },
    { "(I wasn't hesitating.) (But still--) (something didn't feel right.) (Suddenly, I felt the urge to yell.)", 98, 10 },
    { "Graaahhh!", 98, 10 },
    { "(I've waited for this for so long--) (so why am I so confused?)", 98, 10 },
    { "The manikins are out in force. Some of them even hold Summonstones...stay on your toes.", 98, 8 },
    { "Don't have to tell me twice!", 98, 10 },
    { "Not bad, Tidus!", 98, 8 },
    { "Ahh... Heh heh...", 98, 10 },
    { "There he is!", 99, 8 },
    { "Looks like they're arguing.", 99, 10 },
    { "I'm telling you. It's just not my style to sweat the small stuff.", 99, 19 },
    { "So that's your reason for ruining our plans?", 99, 17 },
    { "Dad!", 99, 10 },
    { "I have no more use for you. Fight your son to your heart's content.", 99, 17 },
    { "Well, there's no one to get in our way now.", 99, 19 },
    { "You're... You're hurt, aren't you?", 99, 10 },
    { "Just a scratch. Can't even feel it. I can still snap you like a twig.", 99, 19 },
    { "I thought you came all the way out here to beat me, kid!", 99, 19 },
    { "Yeah, that's right, I did! I did, but--", 99, 10 },
    { "Well?", 99, 19 },
    { "Not like this... Something's not right!", 99, 10 },
    { "Still scared, huh? If you keep questioning yourself, you won't even get what's yours.", 99, 19 },
    { "It must be hard fighting against family.", 99, 8 },
    { "No, that's not it. I still want to fight him and beat him. That hasn't changed a bit. But beating him like he is now-- doesn't feel right. The guy I want to beat--", 99, 10 },
    { "Firion-- I'm sorry. But I have to go do this alone.", 99, 10 },
    { "What?", 99, 8 },
    { "I have to settle this by myself.", 99, 10 },
    { "I've been saving this potion. You know what to do with it.", 99, 8 },
    { "Thanks so much, Firion. I know I'm being selfish... But...this is my story.", 99, 10 },
    { "Finally... I've figured out why I've wanted to beat you for so long. You'd better get ready, dad!", 99, 10 },
    { "Alright... Not much longer to the goal.", 99, 10 },
    { "So...have you made up your mind yet?", 100, 19 },
    { "I have.", 100, 10 },
    { "What's the big idea? You taking pity on me?", 100, 19 },
    { "It didn't feel right-- beating you when you're weak.", 100, 10 },
    { "You're a no-good, self-centered old bastard! But I realized-- The old man I know-- is the guy that always wins, the toughest guy in the world! That's who I have to beat!", 100, 10 },
    { "I'll regret it...if I don't fight you!", 100, 10 },
    { "Then let's do this, huh!?", 101, 19 },
    { "You're finished!", 101, 10 },
    { "Oh?", 101, 19 },
    { "Just beginning!", 101, 10 },
    { "Then how's this?", 101, 19 },
    { "Look what happens when I don't hold back.", 101, 19 },
    { "Well, now you know that nobody can beat me. You're still just a kid. You've got limitless potential running through your veins.", 101, 19 },
    { "You'll be up on your feet by tomorrow.", 101, 19 },
    { "This isn't over yet. There's no tomorrow for me... unless I beat you today!", 101, 10 },
    { "Pesky little runt.", 101, 19 },
    { "Who do you take after?", 101, 19 },
    { "Go ask yourself!", 101, 10 },
    { "Boy, that stings...", 102, 19 },
    { "Dad!", 102, 10 },
    { "Oh, come on... You're fading already?", 102, 10 },
    { "Looks like it.", 102, 19 },
    { "I hate you. I hated you so much... I've always wished you'd be gone. But deep down... what I really wanted was just... your approval... for you to... tell me that I've grown strong--", 102, 10 },
    { "That's not my fault. I can't help it. I'm your son, after all.", 102, 10 },
    { "Hey, cry-baby...", 102, 19 },
    { "You've grown strong.", 102, 19 },
    { "Don't worry. I'll take good care of this.", 102, 10 },
    { "Cecil!", 103, 16 },
    { "At least I can show you my strength!", 103, 7 },
    { "Let's end this fight, here and now.", 104, 0 },
    { "No... It has already been settled.", 104, 1 },
    { "Your fate is to fall... into true darkness.", 104, 1 },
    { "Cosmos!", 104, 10 },
    { "Chaos...", 104, 1 },
    { "For all your wandering, still you end up in purgatory. What a shame, Cosmos.", 104, 12 },
    { "This is not for your to decide. What they must know is true darkness.", 104, 1 },
    { "Your wish shall be granted... I will extinguish all light!", 104, 12 },
    { "Cosmos!", 104, 2 },
    { "The world is unchanging.", 104, 12 },
    { "Powerless beings... Fall into the shadows of despair... and begone.", 104, 12 },
    { "The conflict of the gods has ended. Now you pawns must fade to darkness.", 105, 24 },
    { "You're getting what you deserve. After all, Cosmos died-- because of what you did!", 105, 23 },
    { "What did you say!?", 105, 3 },
    { "It's better that you disappear than to know the brutal truth. Trust me.", 105, 23 },
    { "Fear not.", 105, 24 },
    { "I will wait until you are gone-- before I return the world to the Void.", 105, 24 },
    { "There is not even a speck of light-- I am in absolute darkness.", 105, 0 },
    { "Did I really disappear? If all of us are gone, then that world--", 105, 10 },
    { "Is this it? Is this the way it all ends?", 105, 2 },
    { "No... I don't want it to end.", 105, 5 },
    { "I learned through all the battles that we can't just give up!", 105, 5 },
    { "Even in the deepest despair!", 105, 5 },
    { "Could this be...Cosmos's doing?", 105, 6 },
    { "'What they must know is true darkness...'", 105, 1 },
    { "But they said that we were the ones who killed Cosmos...", 105, 7 },
    { "I think...we should find out the truth.", 105, 8 },
    { "Why Cosmos had to disappear... If WE have to disappear as well... We've got to get some answers!", 105, 4 },
    { "We're not gonna let them have their way.", 105, 9 },
    { "...What is happening to this world?", 105, 0 },
    { "Everything's on the verge of being devoured by chaos...", 105, 4 },
    { "Guess we'd better get moving.", 105, 10 },
    { "It seems the conflict is nearing its end. Shinryu is stirring.", 105, 15 },
    { "...Shinryu?", 105, 22 },
    { "Yes. That which purifies the world. The wyrm will cull the wheat from the chaff and wipe the world clean. A checkmate. And then the board is cleared for another match.", 105, 15 },
    { "So that is how these battles have repeated time and again...", 105, 22 },
    { "Yes. I have had an eternity to master my gambit. But I feel something...unusual this time. The world trembles like never before... Could the Emperor have been able to achieve an absolute death for--", 105, 15 },
    { "We have no interest in that man's petty machinations. All that matters is to engulf all in our shadow. A return to the Void.", 105, 22 },
    { "...Why?", 105, 15 },
    { "The Void fascinates us. Unlike the world and its tiresome conspiracies, it is eternal.", 105, 22 },
    { "I've got a bad feeling... I just know something's waiting for us ahead.", 105, 5 },
    { "Doesn't matter. We decided to fight. That means we'll deal with whatever comes our way.", 105, 9 },
    { "Right!", 105, 5 },
    { "Welcome, dear, dear friends. I've been thinking of just the right thing to say when we met again. So here goes: I'll destroy EVERYTHING and create my own empire of death!", 105, 23 },
    { "Why try so hard to keep living? In the end, nothing truly matters...", 105, 23 },
    { "You're still alive? You pathetic dregs can't even die properly.", 106, 23 },
    { "Kefka...", 106, 6 },
    { "Oh, I know. You came here to be destroyed by me, right? Of course! After what you did to Cosmos, who wouldn't want to follow?", 106, 23 },
    { "Tell me. What is it that you know?", 106, 6 },
    { "You want to hear? Do you? In that case... I'm not telling!", 106, 23 },
    { "Stop fooling around!", 106, 6 },
    { "Beyond the chaos, the end draws near.", 106, 23 },
    { "The long conflict between the gods is finally over.", 107, 17 },
    { "It's gonna start over again, right? We get 'purified' or whatever, then go play with the kids some more...", 107, 19 },
    { "Yes. That would usually be the case. But this time, we saw that Cosmos's death would not be transient, but absolute. Her warriors will also completely vanish...as will we, eventually.", 107, 17 },
    { "What're you talking about?", 107, 19 },
    { "We return to being the mere vessels that we were. That is how this battle will see its true end.", 107, 17 },
    { "Wait a minute, that doesn't sound right. You've been trying to off us all from the beginning? Is that why you called us all here--as pawns of Chaos to do your dirty work?", 107, 19 },
    { "You are wrong on one point, Jecht. You are not Chaos's pawn.", 107, 17 },
    { "...What?", 107, 19 },
    { "It's not enough... Destroy more... Have got to destroy more!\" [gasps for air repeatedly] Terra: \"Just stop! None of this makes any sense!", 108, 23 },
    { "We live to protect what we hold dear. As long as you have that, you can find the meaning on your own.", 108, 6 },
    { "Meaning schmeaning! The whole world's going bye-bye! You included! Life... Dreams... Hope... Where do they come from? And where do they go? None of that junk is enough to fulfill your hearts! Destruction... Destruction is what makes life worth living!", 108, 23 },
    { "Destroy! Destroy! Destroy! Let's destroy everything!", 108, 23 },
    { "It was your broken heart-- You were trying to fill it with destruction...", 108, 6 },
    { "(This misery must not be repeated--ever)", 108, 6 },
    { "I must keep moving forward.", 108, 6 },
    { "If you pledge to lead my soul down the true path... I shall be the savage blade that rends your enemies asunder.", 108, 32 },
    { "You are wrong on one point, Jecht. You are not Chaos's pawn.", 109, 17 },
    { "...What?", 109, 19 },
    { "You most likely don't remember...but you were once a pawn of Cosmos. Harmony and disorder are always arbitrary. You just happen to be on our side now. You are a traitor, a body of the dark with a heart of light. So I set out to use you.", 109, 17 },
    { "Use me?", 109, 19 },
    { "To make crystals--special ones suited for bodies of the dark. Light was born when you faced your son. Then I took the light when you fought him. Tremble in fear... Now I have powers the likes of which even gods can only dream!", 109, 17 },
    { "...I get it now. And I finally get what kind of guy you really are.", 109, 19 },
    { "Where do you think you're going?", 109, 17 },
    { "Off to fight--a REAL fight. With someone who's got the heart for it!", 109, 19 },
    { "...Hmph. Bark while you can. Your time is short. Only I have the power to survive the world's demise. I shall reign in the end!", 109, 17 },
    { "The fighting's been nonstop for some time now. Is everyone alright?", 109, 2 },
    { "Yeah. We're fine. None of us are alone.", 109, 8 },
    { "So you made it this far, huh? Hmph, I don't see the kid around... Whatever. C'mon, show me what you've got. That's what you're here for, right?", 109, 19 },
    { "Heh. Not too shabby. Looks like I've got nothing to worry about.", 109, 19 },
    { "Hey.", 110, 19 },
    { "What are you doing here!?", 110, 10 },
    { "What? Can't even greet your old man? To be honest, I don't really know, either. Well, maybe we've got some unfinished business.", 110, 19 },
    { "What are you talking about?", 110, 10 },
    { "Haven't you learned anything? A real ace fights until the very end. And we just hit overtime.", 110, 19 },
    { "Where did we leave off?", 110, 19 },
    { "So? Are you ready to move on?", 111, 19 },
    { "What?", 111, 10 },
    { "I think you had so much on your mind that you couldn't even take your next step.", 111, 19 },
    { "That's not...", 111, 10 },
    { "You're pathetic. Can't even get one thing right without me, can you?", 111, 19 },
    { "I just--", 111, 10 },
    { "Huh?", 111, 10 },
    { "Accept that you are weak. Accept the path you've taken. Accept that nothing makes sense in this whole damn world! Once you accept everything, then you can choose your next path-- the one path you really want to take.", 111, 19 },
    { "You came here...just to tell me that?", 111, 10 },
    { "Gonna cry again?", 111, 19 },
    { "Shut up.", 111, 10 },
    { "Not for a million gil.", 111, 10 },
    { "See ya.", 111, 19 },
    { "Hey, Dad... Thanks, huh?", 111, 10 },
    { "It was fun. Being your dad and all.", 111, 19 },
    { "Don't worry. I'll save the tears... until everything's over.", 111, 10 },
    { "Something's coming...", 111, 6 },
    { "It feels as though the whole world is reeling...", 111, 0 },
    { "The air has become stagnant. Perhaps because Cosmos is no more...", 111, 7 },
    { "I wonder what she meant by us knowing true darkness... What if the fate of the world is already decided...and all we've done was in vain?", 111, 6 },
    { "...Sure, maybe all we've done is gonna come to nothing. But are we just gonna give up? Now THAT would be a real waste!", 111, 3 },
    { "That's right. All we can do now is keep moving forward. May the crystals bless our world...", 111, 0 },
    { "So, you are all still alive. The power of the crystals is formidable indeed.", 112, 24 },
    { "Power of the crystals? Exdeath, tell us what you know! What did you mean when you said that we killed Cosmos?", 112, 4 },
    { "I suppose I can enlighten you with the truth now. Think of what the crystals are. They are born of the harmonious force possessed by a certain deity.", 112, 24 },
    { "Harmonious force...\" [gasps] \"You don't mean--", 112, 10 },
    { "Indeed, the crystals are shards of Cosmos. They themselves are the goddess's power. And it is because you had obtained them that Cosmos lost her strength and perished. The power of the crystals has allowed the pawns to live on without their master. But so feeble is the light that remains. Even that shall soon fade to nothing.", 112, 24 },
    { "If that light goes out, we would--", 112, 4 },
    { "Return to the womb of the Void.\" [laughs maniacally] Bartz: \"Why'd you do this, Cosmos?", 112, 24 },
    { "If you cannot wait, I will send you on the journey myself. All shall return to nothing, as will I... For eternity!", 112, 24 },
    { "This is the sensation. The boundaries of the flesh are broken, dissolving into nothingness... The Void is where all begins and all ends. Soon, all of you will become a part of this eternity!", 113, 24 },
    { "Why did Cosmos make us get the crystals?", 113, 4 },
    { "I have been defeated.", 113, 1 },
    { "What they must know is true darkness.", 113, 1 },
    { "And you are the last hope left to this world.", 113, 1 },
    { "Cosmos...must have known...that her death was a fate that couldn't be avoided.", 113, 6 },
    { "And knowing that, still gave us the last of her strength? It must be because she had hope. She wanted to pass it on to us.", 113, 4 },
    { "If the crystals--no, if Cosmos granted us her last remaining moments--", 113, 6 },
    { "We can't let them go to waste. Let's fight--with our own strength!", 113, 4 },
    { "Let's do it! We'll fight until we drop!", 113, 3 },
    { "I see the farce still continues.", 113, 17 },
    { "How wonderful to see you all again.", 114, 17 },
    { "It can't be... You lost to Firion!", 114, 2 },
    { "Emperor... You're still alive?!", 114, 8 },
    { "I've come back from the afterworld. This world seems to be looking for a new ruler.", 114, 17 },
    { "It's because of fiends like you that conflict never fades!", 114, 8 },
    { "Save your energy. You've yet to face the true crisis.", 114, 17 },
    { "What?", 114, 5 },
    { "Doesn't sound like he's bluffing. Firion: \"What are you saying?", 114, 2 },
    { "With Chaos victorious, the chains binding us are no more. One schemes the world's return to the Void, while another revels in its ultimate destruction. Each of us has begun to follow the naked desires in our hearts. It is the birth of an utterly chaotic world.", 114, 17 },
    { "Well, we'll just stop every last one of them!", 114, 5 },
    { "We're not handing you the future!", 114, 8 },
    { "We are all here--", 114, 5 },
    { "because none of us are alone! There's no time to stand around.", 114, 8 },
    { "Let's get going.", 114, 2 },
    { "I am nothing but an imitation, after all... I won't even live to see this world collapse. I have nothing left to fear! But I refuse to die alone... You will all join me! A fitting end to this tragic farce!", 114, 21 },
    { "I had nothing more to lose... I only wish I could have realized what it truly means to live...", 114, 21 },
    { "Peace is but a shadow of death, desperate to forget about its painful past. Though we hope for promising years... After shedding a thousand tears, yesterday's sorrow constantly nears.", 115, 21 },
    { "I see that you're just as long-winded as ever.", 115, 3 },
    { "And I see that you never learn. Where will you go after all has been lost?", 115, 21 },
    { "A lady has left the future up to me. I can't run away with my tail between my legs.", 115, 3 },
    { "Yeah. Let the curtains rise.", 115, 3 },
    { "In this world, only the fittest survive. Resign yourself to vanish... into the mellifluous twilight that awaits!", 115, 21 },
    { "As long as there's hope, I'm not going anywhere.", 116, 3 },
    { "Then...I want you to...erase me.", 116, 21 },
    { "What?", 116, 3 },
    { "The world has disowned me. I have been defeated by life itself.", 116, 21 },
    { "Why?", 116, 21 },
    { "Do I need a reason...to help someone? Or is my help...not good enough for you?", 116, 3 },
    { "It's likely that...I will hurt you again.", 116, 21 },
    { "I can take a beating.", 116, 3 },
    { "I don't think...I will ever come to understand you.", 116, 21 },
    { "Kuja?", 116, 3 },
    { "Off with you. Aren't there more important things for you to seize?", 116, 21 },
    { "I return...to where I must...", 116, 21 },
    { "We're going back...to the same place.", 116, 3 },
    { "I finally see... You were tied to Cosmos all along.", 117, 17 },
    { "Everything I did was to save him...but I'm afraid I was oblivious to your scheme. Using crystals possessing the power of darkness...to escape ruination...", 117, 16 },
    { "Do you not see, Golbez? Would you rather accept the end of the world with despair?", 117, 17 },
    { "No, not despair.", 117, 16 },
    { "What?", 117, 17 },
    { "This world is formed of shards brought from different realms by the two gods. As long as Chaos reigns, the shards are fated to sink into endless darkness. But if Chaos perishes, the shards would be released, returning to where they once were. What I seek is hope. They have the strength to defeat Chaos!", 117, 16 },
    { "What foolishness. How could the god of destruction ever be ruined himself? There are no flaws to my plan. Someday, even the gods shall bow down to me!", 117, 17 },
    { "Let us all be prepared. Our enemies will show us no quarter.", 117, 0 },
    { "This struggle of yours is unseemly, Golbez. And unnecessary. Your guidance led Cosmos to an absolute death. Now the cycle MUST come to an end.", 117, 11 },
    { "We have endured many 'ends.' Surely you are aware that this is no different.", 117, 16 },
    { "You misunderstand the desires of the Great Will. My task is yet unfinished... This world is but a testing ground for the development of the ultimate weapon...Chaos. And that is precisely why the cycle of battle had to continue for all eternity.", 117, 11 },
    { "Garland... What is it that you know? Who ARE you?", 117, 16 },
    { "You have come. We have had an eternity in the Void to prepare. We will flood this world with darkness-- and return all to the Void.", 117, 22 },
    { "Mwahahaha... Such conviction. We will meet again, in the endless Void.", 117, 22 },
    { "In the end of infinite solitude-- Disorder shrouds the world in darkness. And now, all things belong in our arms.", 118, 22 },
    { "Her thoughts are with me. They live right here inside.", 118, 5 },
    { "You should know that your bravado is what feeds the darkness!", 118, 22 },
    { "With the gates to the Void wide open, you are already dissolving into darkness. There is nothing more you can do.", 119, 22 },
    { "You're right. If I listened to my head, I'd probably just run.", 119, 5 },
    { "Then why fight?", 119, 22 },
    { "My friends give me the strength. I just need to follow 'this,' and the path will open up.", 119, 5 },
    { "It's only the end if we think it is. We'll change that.", 119, 5 },
    { "You want me to fight with you? I suppose I can help you if you keep it quick.", 119, 32 },
    { "Garland... What is it that you know? Who ARE you?", 119, 16 },
    { "I am a prisoner of time, a witness to all dimensions, all worlds. Throughout all exists the Great Will... It is the key to escaping my eternal prison. And so I have monitored the endless worlds, guiding the conflict of Chaos and Cosmos.", 119, 11 },
    { "That is the task you agreed to?", 119, 16 },
    { "All was to nurture the power of disorder so Chaos could become the ultimate weapon.", 119, 11 },
    { "But is that your true desire?", 119, 16 },
    { "...What is your point?", 119, 11 },
    { "The world itself is a prisoner of time... A prisoner about to be freed. The wheel of fate has already begun to turn. Why not seek a new cycle of hope?", 119, 16 },
    { "...There is no end to my cycle, Golbez. Not as long as he and I are one...", 119, 11 },
    { "...", 119, 16 },
    { "Still...this could turn out to be interesting. Even if there is no hope in the future, I can still know satisfaction... ... at the end of this endless conflict.", 119, 11 },
    { "A world of disorder ruled only by power and desire... Could anything be more sad?", 119, 6 },
    { "Everything's gonna be alright. That's why we're here! We have to do something for all the people who believed in us.", 119, 4 },
    { "Allow me to express my gratitude. Your light has given me hope. Now, draw your swords. I will accept my fate.", 119, 16 },
    { "The flesh may rot, but the soul never perishes...", 119, 16 },
    { "So you still persist. I thought despair would have crushed you by now.", 120, 16 },
    { "Brother, why do you do this?", 120, 7 },
    { "In this world ruled by chaos, I care only that my wish be fulfilled.", 120, 16 },
    { "And what is your wish?", 120, 7 },
    { "The answer must be obtained by your own hands. If you seek it...", 120, 16 },
    { "I understand. The vow with my friends gives me strength!", 120, 7 },
    { "The strength of your vow is impressive indeed.", 121, 16 },
    { "Brother... Why do this?", 121, 7 },
    { "You've no chance against Chaos's forces... if, at this point, you lose the bond with your friends you so cherish.", 121, 16 },
    { "You tested me?", 121, 7 },
    { "And your strength was impressive. You and your comrades should be able to overcome any despair. I will be waiting for that time to come.", 121, 16 },
    { "Where will you--", 121, 7 },
    { "I was summoned by Chaos. That alone is a sign of my heart's weakness. I've no right to be near you.", 121, 16 },
    { "Please wait...", 121, 7 },
    { "Brother!", 121, 7 },
    { "Do you not care what I believe? Because I believe in you. You can fight and win against yourself. I know you can!", 121, 7 },
    { "Cecil...", 121, 16 },
    { "And you and I, we also have a bond between us! I swear that I will never lose. So please, when the time comes... Please join me and my friends-- Golbez: \"My brother, you are too kind-hearted to be a knight.", 121, 7 },
    { "But maybe, someday... If the light should smile upon me...", 121, 16 },
    { "With Cosmos gone, we're doomed to follow. The crystals are the only reason we're still here...", 121, 5 },
    { "...Has what we've done actually made a difference? There was never a way to preserve ourselves, yet she encouraged us to dream... And she knew those hopes were false the whole time. How cruel can a goddess be?", 121, 8 },
