    { "...No. This's a secret between you and me. Got that?", 121, 2 },
    { "My dear tools of war... Do you come to your master, finally tired of the struggles?", 122, 17 },
    { "I've come to settle this.", 122, 8 },
    { "We're not as weak as you might think! We've overcome a lot of hardships to get this far.", 122, 3 },
    { "What are you implying?", 122, 7 },
    { "That everything went as planned. True, giving you her strength was the will of Cosmos herself. But think carefully about who led you to your battles. Is it not obvious-- that you have us to thank?", 122, 17 },
    { "Thank YOU?", 122, 8 },
    { "Cosmos may have been weak, but she was a goddess all the same. To eliminate her completely, it was best to force her-- to let go of her powers. We provided you with your trials. And indeed, you have obtained the crystals.", 122, 17 },
    { "Grr...", 122, 3 },
    { "Granted, there were some amongst us who were overzealous. But you took care of them for us. Indeed, YOU are the forces of darkness that vanquished the goddess.", 122, 17 },
