    { "Is the world...crying?", 124, 9 },
    { "Whatever comes my way, I can take it.", 124, 5 },
    { "As disorder grows in strength, I seem to be regaining my memory. I once took my own life... Perhaps to find a lasting truth beyond this world's illusions.", 124, 13 },
    { "That is absurd. You cannot have regained memories from before you died.", 124, 11 },
    { "Does the soul vanish when life ends?", 124, 13 },
