    { "If the soul is released from the flesh--to unite with the world as spiritual energy... Garland: \"...You are saying the soul lives on?", 124, 13 },
    { "This is merely conjecture. There is no need for you to take it as truth.", 124, 13 },
    { "... This world is composed of elements collected from different realms. If Chaos were to perish, all would be released to give life to new worlds.", 124, 11 },
    { "So we're all going on a journey... If this world ends and a new world begins... what is your wish for the future?", 124, 13 },
    { "My wish...? Do I have the right to have one? I am warfare incarnate, a prisoner to the cycle of battle. As it was, so it shall be... No matter what the world desires.", 124, 11 },
    { "Discord rages with inreasing intensity. We're running out of time.", 124, 8 },
