    { "Even that will dissolve when I compress the world and make it mine. Poor child. It is such a misfortune that you had to be born in my world.", 125, 15 },
    { "Then I suppose your misfortune was in being my enemy.", 125, 2 },
    { "Time waits for no one. You can grab it, but it flies as soon as you loosen your grip. To condense and to bind-- this is all I desire!", 126, 15 },
