    { "For one who has lost all memory, why did the dream have to be so cruel?", 128, 12 },
    { "Chaos...if this is to be our final battle, there is something I must share with you. That this conflict, which has endlessly repeated itself, is according to the Great Will. And I am the one who has made this world the battleground for harmony and disorder. You had no memory, so I guided you in accordance to the Great Will's wish.", 128, 11 },
    { "It was just as I thought... You were the beginning.", 128, 12 },
