    { "The world...along with himself? For what reason?", 133, 0 },
    { "If chaos is a state without form, where all things collide and blend... then ultimate chaos would be the denial of all existence, would it not? At battle's end, there will be no joy, no glory, no salvation, no future. To the god Chaos, a world without Cosmos is naught but an empty husk.", 133, 11 },
    { "He'll destroy all because of the emptiness in his heart?", 133, 0 },
    { "And you... Are you alright with this?", 133, 0 },
